Limit: repository acknowledgement advances only for a clean checkout attached to the manifest's default branch whose old acknowledged head is an ancestor of HEAD; dirty, divergent, detached or wrong-branch checkouts stay DRIFTED and nothing in a registered checkout is reset, fetched or rewritten.
Warn: a session whose process died while the daemon was up stayed READY forever, because only startup reconciliation swept all live sessions; the sweep now also runs on every watchdog tick and settles a session only when the start-aware probe says DEAD, never on UNKNOWN or EPERM, so a revoked CEO generation's identity history keeps serving its successor's Buzz identity fallback.
